    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What this covers",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "This is the console appliance itself, from kvmd's own export. One console serves eight hosts through the downstream KVM switch, and nothing here observes the host on the selected port: HDMI signal, keyboard enumeration and the selected port are not exported. Host health is on [Hosts](/d/hosts).\n\nNot measured: ATX power, which is not wired and is dropped at scrape; uptime; filesystems; and certificate expiry, because the appliance serves its vendor's self-signed certificate.\n\n[Console](https://10.32.20.10/) \u00b7 [Appliance runbook](https://github.com/kelchm/home-lab/blob/main/devices/glkvm/README.md#monitoring)"
      }
    }
